{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Convert All 是一款專注做好單位換算的離線工具，適合經常處理長度、重量、溫度、面積、體積或速度數值的學生、工程人員與出差族。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-147.webp\">\n<h2>無廣告無訂閱的離線換算</h2>\n<p>開啟後選擇分類並輸入一個數值，所有對應結果會同時列出，不必在「由」與「至」之間反覆切換。內建長度、重量、溫度、面積、體積與速度六大分類，涵蓋毫米、公里、磅、加侖等常用單位。全程離線運作，在飛機或地下室同樣可用；沒有廣告、沒有訂閱、不需註冊帳戶，換算結果保留完整精度，不會為求美觀而四捨五入。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-153-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-154-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-155-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-156-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-157-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Convert All: Units Offline</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.679777+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":306,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T08:28:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:18.118132+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:18.118132+00:00","content_hash":"1a6038fa5ec3d1e4cba8686744f565fce3e0b21a28a718623c4919b6d0a4d9ed","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}